{"sha": "cbdf24732efe2e5d9c49916e582c654aa905d64573571c30ad3e5e1faa3f15fa", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "记 $c = [\\ce{A}]$，则 $\\dd c/\\dd t = -akc^n$。", "\\emph{零级}：$\\dd c/\\dd t = -ak$，于是 $c = a_0 - akt$（在", "$c = 0$ 之前成立）。\\emph{一级}：$\\dd c/\\dd t = -akc$ 是一阶线性", "微分方程，其解为 $c = a_0\\eu^{-akt}$。", "\\emph{二级}：$\\dd c/c^2 = -ak\\,\\dd t$；积分，自 0 到 $t$，", "$-1/c + 1/a_0 = -akt$，于是 $1/c = 1/a_0 + akt$。半衰期：令 $c =", "a_0/2$，在各定律中解出 $t$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[半衰期检验]\\label{prop:b1:rate-laws:half-life-test}", "半衰期与初始浓度无关，当且仅当", "反应为一级。零级时半衰期正比于 $a_0$，", "二级时正比于 $1/a_0$。一级反应每次损失剩余量的一半，", "在每个相继的半衰期内减半：经过 $m$ 个半衰期后，", "剩余分数为 $2^{-m}$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对于 $n \\ne 1$ 的级数，分离变量可得 $t_{1/2} = \\dfrac{2^{n-1} -", "1}{(n-1)\\,ak\\,a_0^{n-1}}$，依赖于 $a_0$，除非 $n = 1$；当", "$n = 1$ 时，$t_{1/2} = \\ln2/(ak)$。对一级，$c(t + t_{1/2}) = c(t)/2$", "在每个 $t$ 处，因为 $\\eu^{-ak(t + t_{1/2})} = \\eu^{-akt}/2$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[name=p0,", "  width=0.36\\linewidth, height=4.6cm,", "  xmin=0, xmax=60, ymin=0, ymax=1.05,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "  xlabel={$t$ (min)}, title={零级：$[\\ce{A}]$},", "  title style={font=\\small}, xtick={0,20,40,60},", "  tick label style={font=\\scriptsize}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=t, y=A0] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-integrated-rate-laws.dat};", "\\end{axis}", "\\begin{axis}[at={(p0.east)}, anchor=west, xshift=0.9cm, name=p1,", "  width=0.36\\linewidth, height=4.6cm,", "  xmin=0, xmax=60, ymin=-3.2, ymax=0.2,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "  xlabel={$t$ (min)}, title={一级：$\\ln[\\ce{A}]$},", "  title style={font=\\small}, xtick={0,20,40,60},", "  tick label style={font=\\scriptsize}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omProp, thick] table[x=t, y=lnA1] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-integrated-rate-laws.dat};", "\\end{axis}", "\\begin{axis}[at={(p1.east)}, anchor=west, xshift=0.9cm,", "  width=0.36\\linewidth, height=4.6cm,", "  xmin=0, xmax=60, ymin=0, ymax=4.2,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "  xlabel={$t$ (min)}, title={二级：$1/[\\ce{A}]$},", "  title style={font=\\small}, xtick={0,20,40,60},", "  tick label style={font=\\scriptsize}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=t, y=invA2] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-integrated-rate-laws.dat};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[", "  width=0.62\\linewidth, height=5.0cm,", "  xmin=0, xmax=60, ymin=0, ymax=1.05,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "  xlabel={$t$ (min)}, ylabel={$[\\ce{A}]$ (mol/L)}, xtick={0,10,20,30,40,50,60},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small},", "  legend style={font=\\small, draw=none, at={(0.98,0.98)}, anchor=north east}]", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=t, y=A0] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-integrated-rate-laws.dat};", "\\addplot[omProp, thick] table[x=t, y=A1] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-integrated-rate-laws.dat};", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=t, y=A2] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-integrated-rate-laws.dat};", "\\legend{零级、一级、二级}", "\\draw[dotted] (axis cs:0,0.5) -- (axis cs:20,0.5);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 三个反应具有相同的初始浓度", "（\\qty{1.00}{mol/L}）和相同的初始速率", "（\\qty{0.050}{mol.L^{-1}.min^{-1}}）。上图中，每个积分式在各自坐标系下都化为", "直线。下图为浓度随时间的变化；", "半衰期分别为 10、13.9 和 20 分钟。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{确定速率方程}", "", "\\begin{method}[积分法]\\label{met:b1:rate-laws:integral}", "要由测量数据 $[\\ce{A}](t)$ 检验级数：分别作 $[\\ce{A}]$、", "$\\ln[\\ce{A}]$ 与 $1/[\\ce{A}]$ 对 $t$ 的图像，其中为直线的那一个", "给出级数，其斜率给出 $k$（斜率依次为 $-ak$、$-ak$", "与 $+ak$）。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{method}[半衰期法]\\label{met:b1:rate-laws:half-life}", "测定若干不同初始浓度下的半衰期：若半衰期为常数，", "则为一级；若正比于 $a_0$，则为零级；若正比于 $1/a_0$，则为", "二级。在一次实验中，比较由 $a_0$ 变为 $a_0/2$", "与由 $a_0/2$ 变为 $a_0/4$ 所需的时间；时间相等则为一级。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{definition}[初始速率]\\label{def:b1:rate-laws:initial-rate}", "\\emph{初始速率}\\index{初始速率} $v_0$ 是 $t = 0$ 时刻的速率，", "可视为曲线 $[\\ce{A}](t)$ 在原点处切线的斜率，", "再除以化学计量数。此时", "各物质的浓度均为已知的初始浓度，且尚无生成物产生干涉。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{method}[初始速率法]\\label{met:b1:rate-laws:initial-rates}", "对于 $v_0 = k[\\ce{A}]_0^p[\\ce{B}]_0^q$，先进行仅改变", "$[\\ce{A}]_0$ 的实验，则 $\\ln v_0 = \\ln(k[\\ce{B}]_0^q) + p\\ln[\\ce{A}]_0$，", "以 $\\ln v_0$ 对 $\\ln[\\ce{A}]_0$ 作图，其斜率即为 $p$。实际上，", "将 $[\\ce{A}]_0$ 加倍，$v_0$ 变为原来的 $2^p$ 倍。对 B 做同样处理。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{definition}[孤立法，表观级数]\\label{def:b1:rate-laws:apparent-order}", "在\\emph{孤立法}\\index{孤立法}中，除一种外的所有反应物", "均取大大过量（十倍或以上）。其浓度", "几乎保持不变，于是 $v = k[\\ce{A}]^p[\\ce{B}]^q \\approx k'[\\ce{A}]^p$，", "其中 $k' = k[\\ce{B}]_0^q$。反应表现得如同具有", "\\emph{表观级数}\\index{表观级数} $p$，其表观速率", "常数为 $k'$。这也称为级数的简并。", "\\end{definition}", ""]}